OL,3,GNEWSAAccused Christmas pub killer
OL,4,Asearched for lawyer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of fatally pushing his
OL,7,Falleged father over in a pub beer
OL,8,Fgarden on Christmas Eve made repeated
OL,9,Fsearches for a lawyer before handing
OL,10,Fhimself in, a jury has heard.
OL,12,FMartin Greensmith, 37, admits shoving
OL,13,FSteven Shevels, 61, behind The Queen's
OL,14,FHead in Willington, County Durham, on
OL,15,F24 December, but denies his
OL,16,Fmanslaughter, Teesside Crown Court
OL,17,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
