OL,3,GNEWSAAccused Christmas pub killer
OL,4,Asearched for lawyer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe following day and knowing police
OL,7,Fwanted to arrest him, Greensmith
OL,8,Fmessaged his mother saying his "life
OL,9,Fwas a shambles now all because of a
OL,10,Fpush".
OL,12,FThe court heard Shevels was known to be
OL,13,Fa "nuisance" when drunk in pubs but was
OL,14,Fnever seen to be violent.
